{"id":"f640a74147c5f72b","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-forcing-predense-set.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Predense Set","display":"df-zfc-forcing-predense-set — ZFC Forcing Predense Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-predense-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-predense-set","58-df-zfc-forcing11-predense-set"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-predense-set — ZFC Forcing Predense Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-poset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-predense-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-predense-set</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing11-predense-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-predense-set — ZFC Forcing Predense Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\">\\(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\)</span> (subset, poset, and order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingPredenseSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingPredenseSet}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}predense\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingPredenseSet}_S(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land D\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\land\n\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;\n(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}predense\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingPredenseSet}_S(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land D\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\land\n\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;\n(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-forcing11-predense-set</code> is merged here; it used the same compatibility-with-every-condition predensity formula.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$ (poset predicate, see [[58-df-poset]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingPredenseSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}predense\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingPredenseSet}_S(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land D\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\land\n\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;\n(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q)\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1094,"backlinks":[{"id":"d60c6991f6ccf5f8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1973","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-forcing-predense-set.md|58-df-zfc-forcing-predense-set]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d3f859dbdd37f018"]}